# =============================================================================
# .gitignore — MA-LB-PQ-VDSE benchmark
# =============================================================================

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# CREDENTIALED DATA — never commit, in any form
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# MIMIC-IV is credentialed-access data under a signed DUA. README §14:
# "Do NOT commit MIMIC-IV data, in any form, raw or lightly derived."
# The derived corpus is keyword sets extracted from it and is covered by that
# rule. Its SHA-256 lives in Dataset/dataset_manifest.json, which IS committed
# and is what makes a run traceable without shipping the data.
Dataset/derived/
*.csv.gz
mimic-iv*/

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# SECRETS — never commit
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# This repo has a public GitHub remote. A committed EC2 private key is a
# compromised key, immediately and permanently — rotating it means replacing
# the key pair on every instance. Keep keys in ~/.ssh/, not here; these
# patterns are a backstop, not a licence to store them in the workspace.
*.pem
*.ppk
*.key
id_rsa*
id_ed25519*
.env
*credentials*
aws_config

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# BEFORE MAKING THIS REPO PUBLIC
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# The repo is private, so these stay tracked. If it is ever flipped public
# (e.g. an artifact link in the camera-ready), purge them from history FIRST:
#   References/  IEEE-copyrighted PDFs under an institutional licence
#                ("Restrictions apply" watermark); the .txt files are
#                full-text derivatives and are covered too.
#   Overleaf/    Manuscript source.
# .gitignore alone will not do it — they are already in every commit.

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Infrastructure identity material
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
infra/fabric/crypto-config/
infra/fabric/channel-artifacts/
**/msp/keystore/
*.block
.ipfs/

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Python
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.venv/
venv/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# OS / editor
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# NOT ignored, deliberately
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Schemes/*/exp*/raw_runs.csv, results.csv, run_meta.json  -> committed results
# Dataset/dataset_manifest.json                            -> committed provenance
# Plots/output/*.pdf                                       -> committed figures
